                <pb facs="0629" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg523"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    O’Brien.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Convey through appropriate channel the sincere condolences of the President and
                    of your countrymen upon the death of His Majesty King Christian.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
